# Security headers for the built frontend. Netlify and Cloudflare Pages read this
# file automatically; on another host, set the same headers in its config.
# A Content-Security-Policy is deliberately not set here because it depends on
# your backend's domain - see "Security" in the README for a ready-made one.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000
